1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,060
nothing too drastic - it'll guarantee the kill
用刀不必太激进，这刀稳拿击杀

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:06,040
just clear out jungle, but donk is here
只要清掉jungle，但donk守在这儿

3
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:08,780
finds one of his own. rifle dropped.
迅速拿下人头，步枪应声落地

4
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:12,640
that setup is absolutely perfect here
这个站位简直是完美的伏击点

5
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:17,720
they stack. donk gives distance, finds heads
他们全员贴点，donk拉开距离枪枪上头

6
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:23,520
ace! beautiful from donk, just another round
五杀！donk太漂亮了，常规操作

7
