donk再轰三杀！又是一个多杀

11
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:03,980
the flash in - usually good for one
思路难猜，但这波闪光通常能换一个

12
00:01:05,240 --> 00:01:09,280
zont1x opens it up - done it plenty of times
zont1x会撕开缺口，这活他熟

13
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:13,720
spinx, xertion combine - donk two, wants third
spinx和xertion联手，donk连收两个冲第三杀

14
00:01:15,980 --> 00:01:20,160
break comes in, nice space for donk to work
局面一开，donk有了舒服的周旋空间
